# .cursorrules - Token-Guard Rules for Cursor & Windsurf

- Always use `graph_query` or `graph_slice` before attempting to view or modify codebase files.
- Never read more than 50 lines of code if only a single function needs modification.
- Always check scope boundaries with `check_scope` to prevent accidental edits in unrelated modules.
- If prompt is ambiguous, immediately clarify with the user.
